greet "Paris".
to greet someone:
    say "Hello, " followed by someone followed by "!"
greet with "Rome".
call greet with "Oslo".
to area with width and height:
    give back width times height
say area of 3 and 4
say area with 2 and 5
say area of (1 plus 2) and 4
to pi:
    give back 3.14
say pi times 2
let r be 10
say area of r and r
if area of 2 and 3 is 6, say "six"
say area of (area of 1 and 2) and 3
